# Keep the working tree byte-identical across platforms.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, so a file committed with LF
# comes back with CRLF in someone else's clone — which shows up as a whole-file
# diff the moment they touch it. This package is plain ESM and has no reason to
# care about line endings, so LF everywhere and explicit binary fixtures.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
